## What this project does NOT do

The Apache-2.0 grant above covers **the source code of this package**, and nothing else.

- **It does not upload frames anywhere.** The camera stream is decoded on the phone, inside the
  plugin process. No server, no relay, no analytics.
- **It does not record audio.** The phone build has no audio path; `audioStrip` is off by default
  and there is no audio source to put in it.
- **It does not open the camera by itself.** It reads whatever MJPEG/RTSP endpoint or frame source
  you point it at, from an app you installed and started.
- **It does not host, mirror or redistribute any video.** Nothing is bundled.
- **You are responsible for what you point it at** — including whether photographing a given
  place or person is lawful where you are.

